## "msgid"s in this file come from POT (.pot) files.
###
### TEST FIXTURE, never a real language: "xx" exists only so tests can
### prove the session→plug→Gettext→HEEx chain. It is never negotiated
### from a browser — reachable only when a test or a signed session
### sets locale "xx" (FluxValeWeb.Locale resolves session["locale"]
### against Gettext.known_locales/1).
###
### Merge POT drift: plain `mix gettext.merge priv/gettext` (Gettext
### reads the Plural-Forms header below). Recreate from scratch: "xx"
### is unknown to Expo.PluralForms, so `--locale xx` crashes
### (Gettext.Plural.UnknownLocaleError) and writes nothing — one-off
### `mix run` script defining a custom Gettext.Plural for xx, then
### complete the Plural-Forms header by hand.
### Do not add, change, or remove "msgid"s manually here as
### they're tied to the ones in the corresponding POT file
### (with the same domain).
###
### Use "mix gettext.extract --merge" or "mix gettext.merge"
### to merge POT files into PO files.
